WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Nowadays, more and more students have realized the importance of self-discipline in their personal growth.
如今，越来越多的学生已经认识到自律在个人成长中的重要性。

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:21.230
With smartphones, online games and countless other distractions within easy reach, students who lack self-control can easily waste their precious time and fall behind in their studies.
智能手机、网络游戏和其他无数让人分心的东西近在手边，缺乏自制力的学生很容易浪费宝贵的时间，学业落后。

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:25.180
Self-discipline contributes to growth in several ways.
自律从几个方面促进成长。

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:29.330
To begin with, it is the key to academic success.
首先，它是学业成功的关键。

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:38.230
Students who stick to a regular study schedule tend to learn more efficiently and perform better than those who rely on last-minute cramming.
坚持按固定学习计划学习的学生，往往比那些依赖考前临时抱佛脚的学生学得更高效、表现更好。

00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:42.570
Furthermore, self-discipline benefits physical and mental health.
此外，自律有益于身心健康。

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:49.690
Going to bed on time, exercising regularly and eating sensibly keep us energetic and in a good mood.
按时睡觉、经常锻炼、合理饮食，能让我们精力充沛、心情愉快。

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:53.250
Most importantly, it builds character.
最重要的是，它能塑造品格。

00:00:54.050 --> 00:01:01.260
Each time we resist a temptation or finish a dull but necessary task, we become a little stronger and more reliable.
每当我们抵制住一次诱惑，或完成一项枯燥却必要的任务，我们就会变得更坚强、更可靠一点。

00:01:02.060 --> 00:01:05.360
Developing self-discipline, however, takes time.
然而，培养自律需要时间。

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:16.790
Students can start by setting small, specific goals, such as getting up at seven every morning or reading for thirty minutes a day, and sticking to them until they become habits.
学生可以从设定小而具体的目标做起，比如每天早上七点起床或每天阅读三十分钟，并一直坚持，直到它们成为习惯。

00:01:17.590 --> 00:01:20.680
Keeping a daily record of their progress can also help.
每天记录自己的进步也会有帮助。

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:28.340
Once self-discipline becomes part of their character, students will find it much easier to turn their goals into achievements.
一旦自律成为他们品格的一部分，学生就会发现把目标变成成就要容易得多。
